@@@!atrep-exo
@=at-usfm=>latex

@@/ Hand-Bible format: the classic 148x210 page with 13mm
@@/ margins and the denser 9pt setting (the a5paper class
@@/ option implies it). Everything else inherits from the base
@@/ latex surface.

@-> *document
\documentclass[a5paper]{atrep-bible}
\begin{document}
\atmaketitle
@(grammata)
\end{document}
>-@
